          "type": "text",
          "text": "Value A is initially 40% greater than Value B. Value A then decreases by 15%, while Value B increases by 5%. By what percentage is the new Value A greater than the new Value B? Give your answer to 1 decimal place."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 5,
      "primary_outcome": "3.2",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
      "response": {
